      "summary": {
        "nb": "Rødtvet kirke er kirke i Grorud menighet i Groruddalen prosti i Oslo bispedømme. Den er bygget i 1978 som en arbeidskirke i Oslo kommune, Oslo fylke.",
        "en": "Rødtvet Church is a church center in Oslo, Norway. There is a youth center, an elderly center, a kindergarten and offices. In addition to the church room, there are two congregation halls. The facades of the church building are in brick. On one of the exterior walls hangs a large ceramic cross, created by Konrad Galaaen."
